{"parse": {"title": "SU-05", "pageid": 134647, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/SU-04\" title=\"SU-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">SU-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/SU-06\" title=\"SU-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">SU</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.8E.B7.E9.87.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"获释\">获释</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 获释</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Free at Last</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>将<span class=\"color-value\"></span>重<span class=\"color-value\"></span>获<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>由<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>论<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>益<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>受<span class=\"color-value\"></span>损<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3410105</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">童声：</div><div>黑绒出，小儿苦，良田千里遍尸骨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">童声：</div><div>冬雷吼，乌云布，地裂千里鬼哀哭。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_dilao1\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_dilao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯？这是涣州的地方歌谣吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>班房内，鹭鸶剪竖着耳朵，饶有兴味地听着远处街道上传来的隐约童声，骡子则悠然嚼着铺在班房中的茅草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一边的惠姑尽力地踮着脚扒在班房小小的窗口上，显然没有这种好心情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-642512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-642512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-642512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>他们抓了好多小精怪进来，我一直在数着。就咱们进来这会儿，都有五个了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑垂头丧气地转过身来，靠在班房的土墙上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默了一会儿后，口袋里一直珍藏着的物件被她狠狠地扔在了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>骗子！骗子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>说什么不会被振气铃影响，一点用都没有！还那么贵！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>害得我被那黄狗精连累……！我踩……我把你踩碎……！骗子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>呜……我真是笨到家了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>别急别急，也许等会儿就能被放出去了呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪笑盈盈地看着生气的惠姑，又看了看地上被踩碎的草结护符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯……这护符倒是有用，只不过是最初级的隐身护符，不念咒掐诀的话，对付振气铃倒用处不大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>那人也不算真的骗你，兴许只是没说清楚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>你，你还替他讲话？我都已经……到这了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>哎呀，早晚会出去的嘛。他们又不可能关我们一辈子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪捡起破碎的草结护符，念念有词了几句，擦了擦灰，递给惠姑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>留着吧，万一以后有用呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>我才不要这玩意儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好吧，那我收着。你别生气啦，他们还不知道我用一捆稻草替了你，等我脱身后，你也就可以进城啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>唉……早知道……我就不该来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这安慰显然于事无补，惠姑头上的草饰都耷拉了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪则是专注地看起了班房角落的石头，仿佛世间一切纷扰与她无关。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_dilao1\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_dilao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>好一会儿后，她忽地惊呼起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>成了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>什、什么成了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪略微移步，露出了班房角落的一块石头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上面正刻着“我与惠姑到此一游”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>在这里闲着也是闲着，不如留个纪念。你看，我刻得如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑看向那还留有碎屑的石砖，字迹的凹陷处正贴合鹭鸶剪指尖的宽度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>你……用手刻的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>云游时收集到的小法术，隔空刻字。只是力道不好控制，总显得不够美观。你有什么想刻的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>你的术法……就用来做这些？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314112.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314112.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-314112.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314112.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯？稍等，是我疏忽了。其实这术法不只能刻字……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪保持着俯身的姿势，右手掐诀，指尖缠绕着一股凌冽白气，指尖缓缓在空中滑动，砖石上便一点点勾勒出一株苇草。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>还能刻图呢！这样后来的人，也知道我们来过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑脸上的神情很难称之为高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>鹭鸶剪，你刚刚还讲拿稻草替了我……这下他们看了字和图样，不就全露馅了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>啊——！大意了，我现在就把它擦了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>本来还想着，这至少能留个一万年呢！——不好，这下可露了大馅了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>等一下……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑轻轻地摇了摇头，制止了鹭鸶剪的动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>……留着吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>就像你讲的，留个纪念吧。如果一万年后还有一个人，知道我曾来过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>那……也不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音中有一股难以察觉的悲伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪若有所思地看着惠姑，最终还是微笑地点了点头，没有抹去那小小的法术痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好好……反正你别再着急啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处传来一阵急促的脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>他们来了！你现在别出声，我把你藏起来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪催动咒诀，惠姑就变成了一张纸人，柔顺地飞进了她的袖口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-642812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-642812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-642812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杨武：</div><div>程巡检，那道人就关在此处。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_dilao2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_dilao2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_dilao2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光与杨武打开了牢门，走到了鹭鸶剪身前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杨武：</div><div>你说你是道士？可有度牒？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>齐全的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接过了度牒，程和光眉头紧皱，审视的目光在度牒、鹭鸶剪和骡子三者中挪移着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-642813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-642813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-642813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杨武：</div><div>签发年月竟在洪武年间？那距今岂不是已有百年？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-313701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>修道之人，看上去年轻些也不奇怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杨武难以置信地看着鹭鸶剪，而程和光则更加严谨地比对起度牒的细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>那在城门处败露真身的草本精怪，与你是什么关系？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>小道与她不熟，只是在城门处碰巧遇到……我都不知道她原来还是精怪呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光没有接话，只是抬眼看了看鹭鸶剪，便又开始审视起度牒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>莫不是我这度牒上还需带上那笨骡子的名字？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>你那骡子也入了教门吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>没有的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>那就不用写。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-642813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-642813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-642813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">杨武：</div><div>……这都什么和什么啊？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>比对许久，程和光终于将度牒交还给了鹭鸶剪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>度牒没有问题，可以走了，但你下次若再惹起事端，肯定不会让你走得如此轻易。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>小道向来遵纪守法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>确认鹭鸶剪没有问题后，程和光的注意力便不再放在她的身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>那草木精怪呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">杨武：</div><div>在隔壁，显出原型后，她便一直没有再恢复人形，估计是想以此躲避牢狱之灾……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二人便这样走向下一间班房，鹭鸶剪则忙不迭地拽着骡子离开这个幽暗潮湿的地方。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好啦，你活动活动腿脚，看看有什么不舒服的地方没有？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>寻了个没人的地方，纸人从鹭鸶剪的袖中飘出，落在地上，并在一阵烟雾中变回了惠姑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-314110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>如何？我就说一定能将你也救出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>嗯——嗯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>变成纸人的感觉可真怪……听不真切，看得模糊……还动不得……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>但我听到什么……洪武年间……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嘿嘿，我那度牒，算是个古董……万幸，那巡检比看起来好糊弄……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>对了，你之前说要进城做什么来着？可还来得及？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>这个啊……嗯……啊，你肚子饿吗，鹭鸶剪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑指了指不远处的摊位。街上人群已多了起来，摊主的招揽之声也更加卖力了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>热气蒸腾的笼屉旁，已有不少人翘首以盼，惠姑也自然地加入了队列。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>唉，一天都没吃东西了，早知道就吃一口你的清白盏了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>你们要的桂花糯米糕蒸好了喂，热烘烘，甜滋滋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>好，谢谢——诶，好香的桂花啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑迫不及待地咬下去，一股清甜软熟的香气四溢开来，她忍不住发出一句幸福的叹气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>呼——真是，真是太好吃了……呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>真有这么好吃？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>很甜、很糯，很……总，总之，鹭鸶剪你也试试吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惠姑笑着递给鹭鸶剪一块略有些烫手的桂花糯米糕，鹭鸶剪左看右看，最后轻轻放入口中。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_at_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_at_19\"><img alt=\"3_4_at_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-3_4_at_19.png/600px-Cg-3_4_at_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-3_4_at_19.png/900px-Cg-3_4_at_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-3_4_at_19.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_at_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>怎……怎么样？好吃吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>唔，唔……口感很奇妙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鹭鸶剪努力地嚼着桂花糕，似乎正在寻找着那传说中的滋味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好像……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-642511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>好像什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她看着惠姑那幸福地嚼着桂花糕的模样，不自觉地模仿着对方，那桂花糕似乎也尝出了味道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好像……还挺甜的，嗯，确实越吃越香甜啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"642510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"642510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-642510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-642510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>我就说！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>好吃，好吃，我得再多吃几口，惠姑你也多吃点……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-3_4_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>看你们风尘仆仆，应该也是慕名来参加这次庙会的吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗝……是啊，看今年的庙会办得特别大，特别好玩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>也是拜了那个“谣言”的福，今年我们这些做小本生意的也赚了不少钱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>只有今年？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>嗯……这几年，这个教那个教的，其实都在附近城里兴盛过，追求的都是长生成仙之类的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>不过，今年可不一般喽……客官，我也是听说的，您就当听个乐子。今年庙会本就办得隆重，大家都传，是因为有富商老爷求到真的仙人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>这件事我也听过……我朋友的朋友的朋友的亲戚，早该在几年前就寿终正寝，但他今年却突然回家了，说自己在祝县受了仙人点拨，才活到现在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>据说呐，今晚的戏就是那群富商老爷给仙人办的“入世典仪”呢，那戏台的规模都比往常大个好几倍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>啊……这么厉害啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>而且，这些捕风捉影暂且不说，你就说那些个官差，往年传啥他们都没什么反应，今年却如临大敌一般，我看啊，这事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>嗯——可是听来听去，全是听说和猜测，到现在都没个实影……眼不见为虚，倒不是很有意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>想有意思？去看高跷巡神啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>高跷巡神！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">鹭鸶剪：</div><div>就是你路上总说的那个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>对！听讲热闹得紧。在哪里能看呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"622320.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"622320.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-622320.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-622320.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">摊主Ⅰ：</div><div>马上就来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>店主盖上了蒸笼，闪身走到了店铺之中，于门后消失了踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>街上不知何时失去了热闹的氛围，路人倏地都不见了，一股诡异的氛围如沉雾般从街头蔓延了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">惠姑：</div><div>嗯？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "SU-05"}}